  "short_description": "在這款《掘地求升》式的 3D 高難度平臺遊戲裡，一路把自己彈到最頂端！把杆子戳到牆上，掰彎，再借著彈力把自己高速甩出去！一個失誤，你就可能掉回最底下。你能在兩小時內登頂，把這筆退款“賺”到手嗎？！",
  "short_description_en": "Fling yourself up to the top in this “Getting Over It”-like 3D platformer! Stick your pole to walls, bend it and fling yourself with great speed! One mistake means falling all the way down. Can you reach the summit in under 2 hours and EARN that refund?!",
